    Path 1: Accumulation. Add stability, multiple aspects, provenance, more actuators, more interpretation rules, and more state because each seems useful in isolation. Eventually, the architecture becomes impressive on paper, but nobody can tell which parts are essential, whether they work together, or whether the extra complexity produces a better game.

